  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/758c3b33866c4700d9.jpg\"><img alt=\"ספר שיער מקצועי - אלא שהוא עצמו קירח...\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/758c3b33866c4700d9.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">סאטירה על סתירות פנימיות ועל סנדלר ברגליים יחפות</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פרדוקס הוא משפט, או הֶגֵּד (אמירה), או התנהגות - עם סתירה פנימית.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לדוגמא:</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פעם אחת, הייתה משפחה מאוד עניה.<br />האבא היה עני,<br />האימא הייתה עניה,<br />הילדים היו עניים,<br />המשרתים היו עניים...</span></span></blockquote><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גם בפרשתנו מצויים פרדוקסים:</span></span></p><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֵשָׂו הרשע - משים עצמו צדיק.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַבְּכוֹרָה היוקרתית - נמכרת בנזיד עדשים.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אבימלך - העומד בראש העם הפלישתי הפראי - מכתיר את עצמו \"אַחַד הָעָם\".</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אבל, האמת היא, שגם בחיי היומיום, ניתן למצוא לא מעט פרדוקסים.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לדוגמא:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤓</span>אופטיקאי פוזל<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦿</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אורתופד גיבן<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧪</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">אורולוג עקר<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍪</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">אופה רגיש לגלוטן<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧔</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">אנגלי עם זקן צרפתי<br /><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😬</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אוֹרְתוֹדֵנְט עם שיניים בולטות</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤡</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">בדרן עצוב<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👃</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשָּׁם תַּתְרָן</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">♿</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">גְּרֵנְטוֹלוֹג&nbsp;סיעודי<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🗺️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">גֵּאוֹגְרָף&nbsp;חסר חוש התמצאות<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚹</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גַּסְטְרוֹלוֹג עִם מְעִי רָגִיז</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍩</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">דיאטנית שמנה<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🛩️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">דיילת מכוערת<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🐝</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">דבוראי אלרגי לדבורים<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦻</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">די ג'יי כבד שמיעה</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧿</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">הִילֶר חָסוּם צַ'קְרוֹת<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">💭</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">הוגה דעות חסר דעת<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👈</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">הֶנְדִּימֶן&nbsp;עם 2 ידיים שמאליות</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😾</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">וטרינר פוחד מחיות</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎤</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">זמר צרוד<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔍</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">זגג ושמו&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שְׁבִירוֹ</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🥛</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">חלבן רגיש ללקטוז<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤕</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">חובש פצוע</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔒</span>טכנאי מעליות&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>קְלָאוּסְטְרוֹפוֹבִּי<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍔</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">טבח רזה</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📡</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">יועץ תקשורת אוטיסט<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👰</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יועץ נישואין גרוש<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍬</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">יצרן ממתקים סוכרתי<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😢</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">יועץ תעסוקה מובטל</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔥</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כבאי פירומן<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🏧</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כלכלן עני<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😷</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כירורג רועד<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🆕</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כתב חדשות מיושן</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😛</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">לְשׁוֹנָאִי אילם</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎰</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">מוכר פיס חסר מזל<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">💅</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">מניקוריסטית כוססת ציפורניים<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎗️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">מזכירה שכחנית</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦼</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">נוירולוג משותק<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔄</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">נווט ללא חוש כיוון</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">✂️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">סַפָּר&nbsp;קירח<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚬</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">סוחר סמים בגמילה</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎭</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">עוזר אישי חסר אישיות<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">✊</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">עובדת סוציאלית מֻכָּה</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🥴</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">פלסטיקאי עם פני צלקת<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">↩️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">פוליטיקאי ישר<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤪</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">פסיכיאטר פסיכי</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🕶️</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">צלף כבד ראיה<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎨</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">צבעי עיוור צבעים<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: no